@title Door wire lengths follow the enclosure spec
@area Reports
# Five copies of one cabinet with a wire from the plate to a device on the door: no spec, spec A (depth 300, catalogue), spec B (depth 500, catalogue), spec from the maker's STEP, and a spec without plate setback. The wire list length changes with the spec (B is 200 mm longer than A); catalogue numbers are marked ~ and the sheet says it is an estimate; the STEP spec has no ~; the gap says the spec has no depth.
# Fixtures: qa/fixtures/door-wire-*.novo (cargo test -p novo-reports --test reports write_door_wire_spec_fixtures -- --ignored)
open qa/fixtures/door-wire-no-spec.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text Wire list
key enter
wait 15
expect "door, no gap"
shot wire-list-no-spec
check_layout
key Escape
wait 5
open qa/fixtures/door-wire-spec-a.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text Wire list
key enter
wait 15
expect "~ door + depth (catalogue)"
expect "Estimate from catalogue data"
shot wire-list-spec-a
check_layout
key Escape
wait 5
open qa/fixtures/door-wire-spec-b.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text Wire list
key enter
wait 15
expect "~ door + depth (catalogue)"
expect "Estimate from catalogue data"
shot wire-list-spec-b
check_layout
key Escape
wait 5
open qa/fixtures/door-wire-spec-step.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text Wire list
key enter
wait 15
expect "door + depth (spec)"
shot wire-list-spec-step
check_layout
key Escape
wait 5
open qa/fixtures/door-wire-spec-gap.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text Wire list
key enter
wait 15
expect "~ door, spec has no depth"
expect "Estimate from catalogue data"
shot wire-list-spec-gap
check_layout
key Escape
wait 5
# The cabinet route view: the gap fixture shows the yellow spec gap line with the enclosure's missing number.
open qa/fixtures/door-wire-spec-gap.novo
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text Route all wires
wait 6
key Enter
wait 40
expect "no plate setback"
shot route-spec-gap
check_layout
# Long tags and potential names: Length basis still shows.
open qa/fixtures/door-wire-long-names.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text Wire list
key enter
wait 15
expect "~ door + depth (catalogue)"
shot wire-list-long-names
check_layout
